50</sub></bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>EDD</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>CHK2</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">HOSE17.1</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.90</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">CaOV3</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.20 (1)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.30 (1)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">3.78 (4)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">OVCAR3</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.20 (1)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.43 (5)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">11.81 (6)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">A2780</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.55 (3)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.85 (6)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">5.99 (5)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">SKOV3</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">3.55 (4)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.91 (4)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.38 (1)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">COLO316</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">11.20 (5)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.53 (3)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">3.43 (3)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">A2780/cp70</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">13.60 (6)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.37 (2)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2.44 (2)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t4-fn1"><label>a</label><p>Determination of IC<sub>50</sub> is described in the Materials and methods.</p></fn><fn id="t4-fn2"><label>b</label><p>Expression was determined by western blotting as described in the Materials and methods. Average expression was calculated from duplicate blots and is expressed as relative values as compared to HOSE17.1 cells. Ranks for the Spearman rank correlation test are shown in brackets.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>